# Which machine bit each place brings home: on the map, on the place's card, and a hint on the ? cloud
# of a place nobody's found yet (the old shed: bolts).
from after_tutorial
flags --pick=garden
view full
wait 1
expect text "brings home springs"
expect fits
shot card
pets 3
send meadow 1
send pond 1
click "‹ map"
wait 1
expect fits
shot map
